<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>EXOTIC</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Qrystral</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">damienfarron</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EXOTIC</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4Q56V4HHW3HBt7Ti10QTH7</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.740" end="00:13.370">I just copped a new bitch, she exotic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.370" end="00:16.580">Curvaceous and she drippin on my bed, that's aquatic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.580" end="00:19.740">She wanna taste my uh, gimme top, idiotic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.740" end="00:22.920">But I can't keep her close, she be talking with a varnish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.920" end="00:26.710">Can't break my concentration, I ain't taking the narcotics, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.710" end="00:29.910">I just get my racks in, I don't even go to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.910" end="00:32.260">Yeah it's hella taxing, oh my god</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.260" end="00:34.720">Yeah, gotta get the reps in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.720" end="00:39.510">Keep that pedal to the metal, for I'll lose my traction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.510" end="00:42.110">All these nights inside my room, I'm feeling stressed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.110" end="00:45.590">You got my heart aching every day, I need some rest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.590" end="00:48.670">All that attitude baby, let's put it to the test</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.670" end="00:52.270">I don't give a **** about you bitch, I'm not impressed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.270" end="00:54.730">When I speak I'm making profit, I'm exotic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.730" end="00:57.940">If your girlfriend's on my line, that's not my problem, I'm just toxic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.940" end="01:01.070">Make you do just what I want, just like a puppet, baby suck it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.070" end="01:04.950">Man I love it, everything she saying just makes me wanna **** it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.950" end="01:07.810">She telling me her last name, she think I want her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.810" end="01:10.950">Girl you're just my attraction, not my accomplice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.950" end="01:14.250">You poisoned me with all your lovely words and your disguises</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.250" end="01:16.290">Shorty gets everything she wants cause she's exotic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.290" end="01:20.550">She exotic, curvaceous and she drippin on my bed, that's aquatic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.550" end="01:23.790">She wanna taste my uh, gimme top, idiotic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.790" end="01:26.970">But I can't keep her close, she be talking with a varnish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.970" end="01:30.680">Can't break my concentration, I ain't taking the narcotics, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.680" end="01:33.930">I just get my racks in, I don't even go to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.930" end="01:36.230">Yeah it's hella taxing, oh my god</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.230" end="01:38.710">Yeah, gotta get the reps in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.710" end="01:42.020">Keep that pedal to the metal, for I'll lose my traction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.020" end="01:46.020" /></div></body></tt>